 "My words toward backtracking came in the autumn of 2026."
 "On 29 September I described how the work is validated, a seed of backtracking, not by doing it again but by replaying it. “the way we validate isnt doing it again. It's re-running the same prompts from that point, simulating everything but with a corrected and branched prompt. That way its autonomously improving”.[[m:2026-09-29]]"
 "On 8 October backtracking was named as THE MAP keeps it. “1. Smile Backtracking - in real time/smile harness we will revisit assumptions, code, previous branches, other potentials etc to make sure that it is all still in alignment, this is a constant automatic process by all instances of”[[m:2026-10-08]] every agent. On 16 October I asked for the scenario optimizer, which is part built, “For every single prompt historically, it replays the same scenario, testing hypothses for what happens, validating them, testing it all end to end”.[[m:2026-10-16]]"
